WEBVTT

00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:09.801
Pizza delivery.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.763
Wow. So, this is a real TV station, huh?

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:15.182
Well, it's a Fox affiliate.

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:16.725
What are you showing right now?

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.143
Single Female Lawyer.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.270
It's the season finale. You want to watch?

00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:22.648
Ah, I don't know. That's a chick show.

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:26.568
I prefer programs of the genre
world's blankiest blank.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.987
She is wearing
the world's shortiest skirt.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.656
I'm in.

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:33.784
Counselor, I remind you

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.161
that it's unethical
to sleep with your client.

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:38.372
If you really care about the outcome
of the case,

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.873
you should sleep with me.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.542
Your Honor, it's bad enough

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:44.461
to proposition
a single female lawyer in court,

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:46.463
but this is a unisex bathroom.

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:47.923
Overruled, counselor.

00:00:51.552 --> 00:00:53.345
Could you repeat that last part?

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:02.312
Oh, my God! You knocked Fox off the air!

00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:04.606
Pfft! Like anyone on Earth cares.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:25.752
Could you repeat that last part?

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.299
This is an outrage!

00:01:30.382 --> 00:01:33.010
I demand to know what happened
to the plucky lawyer

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:35.179
and her compellingly short garment.

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:37.890
Due to technical difficulties,

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:40.225
we now bring you
eight animated shows in a row.

00:02:15.427 --> 00:02:17.763
What in the name of Bob Marley's ghost?

00:02:17.846 --> 00:02:19.848
- Get to work, you lazy boltbag.
- Ow!

00:02:20.015 --> 00:02:21.433
Ow!

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.977
Hey, quit it, Hermes. It's Labor Day.

00:02:24.061 --> 00:02:26.355
Labor Day? That phony-baloney holiday

00:02:26.438 --> 00:02:28.857
crammed down our throats
by fat-cat union gangsters?

00:02:28.941 --> 00:02:31.276
- That's the one.
- Hot damn. A day off.

00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:36.615
Who's up for one last summer beach trip?

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.867
- Oh, yeah.
- Ready, Freddy.

00:02:39.117 --> 00:02:40.702
Eh, I think I'll just stay here.

00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:44.122
Fry, you're wasting your life
sitting in front of that TV.

00:02:44.206 --> 00:02:46.291
You need to get out
and see the real world.

00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:48.418
But this is HDTV.

00:02:48.502 --> 00:02:50.712
It's got better resolution
than the real world.

00:02:50.796 --> 00:02:53.298
Everyone's too polite
to say anything,

00:02:53.382 --> 00:02:55.717
but you're covered with bedsores.

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:58.053
- Not covered.
- Just get in the car.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.103
Ah! Here we are.

00:03:10.983 --> 00:03:14.319
Wait. Mount Rushmore
and the Leaning Tower of Pisa?

00:03:14.653 --> 00:03:17.155
- I didn't know they were both in New York.
- They are now.

00:03:17.239 --> 00:03:20.576
In the 2600s, New Yorkers elected
a super-villain governor,

00:03:20.659 --> 00:03:22.911
and he stole most
of the world's monuments.

00:03:22.995 --> 00:03:25.873
Truly a great man. Look at him up there.

00:03:39.636 --> 00:03:40.637
Aha!

00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:43.807
Found you.

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:46.018
Okay, now you go hide.

00:03:49.104 --> 00:03:50.230
Nice knowing you.

00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:53.192
Ah!

00:04:00.032 --> 00:04:02.826
Come on, Zoidberg.
I passed it right to you.

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:06.955
Ugh! I've had it with this game.
I'm going for a scuttle.

00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:14.880
Okay, everyone, come and get it!

00:04:20.427 --> 00:04:24.348
Ah! Just like my dad used to make,
until McDonald's fired him.

00:04:24.431 --> 00:04:26.683
Bite my red-hot glowing ass.

00:04:27.184 --> 00:04:28.769
Wait a minute.

00:04:29.228 --> 00:04:30.896
Red-hot glowing ass?

00:04:31.146 --> 00:04:32.481
I'll be right back.

00:04:32.856 --> 00:04:35.108
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:04:36.818 --> 00:04:37.903
Oh!

00:04:37.986 --> 00:04:39.279
Yeah.

00:04:40.489 --> 00:04:41.573
Mmm!

00:04:45.452 --> 00:04:46.912
No. Nibbler.

00:04:48.622 --> 00:04:50.290
Psst!

00:04:50.374 --> 00:04:53.126
Professor, I need another bikini.

00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:54.503
Wha...

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.256
Oh! Okay. I think there's one can left.

00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:01.718
Oh, my.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:05.347
There. How do I look?

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.474
Like a cheap French harlot.

00:05:07.558 --> 00:05:08.934
French?

00:05:15.649 --> 00:05:20.070
Say, dollface, how'd you like
to make time with a real man?

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:22.906
No. I'm not attracted to bullies,

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:26.368
no matter how big and handsome they are.

00:05:26.451 --> 00:05:29.246
It's okay, Leela, go ahead.
I got a lot of work to do here.

00:05:29.413 --> 00:05:33.792
Sir, you don't understand.
I'm a professional beach bully.

00:05:33.876 --> 00:05:37.421
I pretend to steal your girl,
you punch me, I go down,

00:05:37.504 --> 00:05:40.090
she swoons, you slip me 50 bucks.

00:05:40.174 --> 00:05:41.300
50 bucks?

00:05:41.383 --> 00:05:44.094
Not even if she was my girlfriend.
You take her.

00:05:44.178 --> 00:05:45.637
Fry.

00:05:45.721 --> 00:05:49.349
Although I suppose we could go
for a walk on the beach.

00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:51.852
Uh... No, thanks, ma'am. I'm actually gay.

00:05:59.484 --> 00:06:01.778
Uh-oh. Help. Help!

00:06:06.283 --> 00:06:07.826
Bender, you got to spring me.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.829
I'll never survive in here.
I'm too pretty.

00:06:10.913 --> 00:06:13.540
All right, all right. I'll bust you out.

00:06:17.961 --> 00:06:19.213
Cheese it!

00:06:21.548 --> 00:06:24.510
Voilà.
The greatest sand castle ever built.

00:06:24.593 --> 00:06:26.929
The kind of castle
King Arthur would have lived in

00:06:27.012 --> 00:06:29.473
- if he were a fiddler crab.
- It's very nice.

00:06:29.556 --> 00:06:31.767
We should get a picture
before the tide comes in.

00:06:32.059 --> 00:06:33.769
Oh, yeah. Anyone have a camera?

00:06:33.852 --> 00:06:34.978
Right here, buddy.

00:06:37.105 --> 00:06:39.107
Wait. I want to be in the picture, too.

00:06:43.445 --> 00:06:44.613
Pretend you're happy.

00:06:55.791 --> 00:06:56.917
Oh, my God!

00:06:59.211 --> 00:07:00.546
What in Babylon?

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:14.601
No!

00:07:24.486 --> 00:07:25.571
Faster!

00:07:26.697 --> 00:07:28.282
We're all gonna die, aren't we?

00:07:28.365 --> 00:07:30.033
Oh, I should think so.

00:07:30.117 --> 00:07:31.994
Although, last time aliens invaded

00:07:32.077 --> 00:07:34.955
all they did was force
the most intelligent of us

00:07:35.038 --> 00:07:37.666
to pair off and mate continuously.

00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:39.334
Oh, yes.

00:07:41.253 --> 00:07:44.965
Once again, today's winning
lotto number was four.

00:07:45.299 --> 00:07:49.511
In other news, alien saucers continue
to rain destruction upon Earth.

00:07:49.595 --> 00:07:53.807
We now go live to an emergency address
by Earth president McNeal.

00:07:54.141 --> 00:07:56.602
Ladies and gentlemen,our course is clear.

00:07:56.977 --> 00:07:59.438
The time has come to knuckle under.

00:07:59.521 --> 00:08:02.983
To get down on all fours
and really lick boot.

00:08:03.066 --> 00:08:05.444
Give our alien masters
whatever they want and...

00:08:06.528 --> 00:08:07.696
People of Earth,

00:08:07.779 --> 00:08:11.450
I am Lrrr, of the planetOmicron Persei 8.

