Is this thing on?

00:08:14.786 --> 00:08:18.373
Now, then.
We want the one you call McNeal.

00:08:18.457 --> 00:08:21.335
Give us McNeal,
or we will lay waste to your cities

00:08:21.418 --> 00:08:23.587
