00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.797
We demand McNeal!

00:08:27.424 --> 00:08:29.676
Uh... As I was saying...

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:31.720
mankind would sooner perish

00:08:31.803 --> 00:08:36.141
than kowtow to outrageous
alien demandsfor this McNeal...

00:08:36.225 --> 00:08:38.602
Whoever he is. Am I right?

00:08:40.312 --> 00:08:44.483
And now, the man who will lead us
in our proud struggle for freedom,

00:08:44.566 --> 00:08:49.154
fresh from his bloody triumph
over the pacifists of the Gandhi Nebula,

00:08:49.238 --> 00:08:52.074
