00:08:55.619 --> 00:08:56.703
Hey, look, Leela.

00:08:56.787 --> 00:08:59.039
It's that idiotic windbag you slept with.

00:08:59.122 --> 00:09:02.918
The Earth is under attack.
Can't we just forget about that?

00:09:03.001 --> 00:09:04.503
Evidently not.

00:09:04.628 --> 00:09:07.673
Call me cocky, but if there's an alien
out there I can't kill,

00:09:07.756 --> 00:09:11.009
I haven't met him and killed him yet.
But I can't go it alone.

00:09:11.093 --> 00:09:15.055
That's why I'm ordering
every available ship to report for duty.

00:09:15.138 --> 00:09:16.974
Anyone without a ship
should secure a weapon

00:09:17.057 --> 00:09:18.934
and fire wildly into the air.

00:09:19.059 --> 00:09:22.396
Well, you heard the windbag.
We've been drafted.

00:09:22.479 --> 00:09:23.814
Everyone into the ship.

00:09:23.939 --> 00:09:25.816
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on!

00:09:25.899 --> 00:09:28.986
I refuse to fight.
I'm a conscientious objector.

00:09:29.069 --> 00:09:31.113
