00:09:41.999 --> 00:09:43.083
Oh, crap.

00:09:51.466 --> 00:09:53.302
You're all from different cultures here.

00:09:53.385 --> 00:09:55.512
Some of you are white.
Some of you are black.

00:09:56.054 --> 00:09:58.974
You're brown. And you're silver.

00:09:59.057 --> 00:10:02.978
But I don't care if your skin's
