00:10:03.061 --> 00:10:05.731
You're all going to have
to learn to die together.

00:10:05.814 --> 00:10:07.733
- Am I right, soldier?
- Well, actually, I...

00:10:08.942 --> 00:10:10.694
Sir! Yes, sir! Sir!

00:10:10.777 --> 00:10:14.448
Remember, our mission is simple.
Destroy all aliens.

00:10:14.907 --> 00:10:17.075
Um... Eh... Not me, sir.

00:10:17.326 --> 00:10:20.579
Oh, yes. Right. Nobody destroy Kif.

00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:21.788
Unless you have to.

00:10:22.706 --> 00:10:24.124
Oh, ho, ho.

00:10:24.291 --> 00:10:26.585
The luscious Captain Leela.

00:10:26.668 --> 00:10:29.922
This is turning into
one very sexy struggle

00:10:30.047 --> 00:10:32.216
