00:10:32.299 --> 00:10:34.843
Thanks, but I'm not technically human.

00:10:34.927 --> 00:10:38.222
Right, right.
Nobody destroy Leela, either.

00:10:38.347 --> 00:10:40.516
The key to victory is discipline,

00:10:40.599 --> 00:10:42.100
