an idiot could have devised it.

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:08.126
On my command, all ships will line up

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.046
and file directly
into the alien death cannons,

00:11:11.129 --> 00:11:12.589
clogging them with wreckage.

00:11:12.673 --> 00:11:15.926
Wouldn't it make more sense
to send the robots in first and...

00:11:18.428 --> 00:11:21.098
Sir! I volunteer for a suicide mission!

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:23.058
Ah! Cut it out!

00:11:23.141 --> 00:11:25.769
You're a brave robot, son,
but when I'm in command,

00:11:25.853 --> 00:11:27.729
