in case neither of us comes back.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.410
Here's hoping.

00:11:42.369 --> 00:11:43.370
Muah!

00:11:53.338 --> 00:11:54.798
I'm gonna be a sci-fi hero

00:11:54.882 --> 00:11:58.093
