or Captain Janeway or Xena.

00:11:58.177 --> 00:12:02.431
Fry, this isn't TV, it's real life.
Can't you tell the difference?

00:12:02.514 --> 00:12:04.349
Sure. I just like TV better.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:21.575
Bender, damage report.

00:12:21.658 --> 00:12:24.703
The auxiliary power's out.
And they spilled my cocktail.

00:12:26.246 --> 00:12:30.542
All right, scumwads,
this one's for Bender's cocktail.

00:12:42.304 --> 00:12:44.264
We did it! We won!

00:12:44.348 --> 00:12:48.560
Yeah, but it'll never
bring back my martini.

00:12:48.644 --> 00:12:50.604
Well, who wants a martini?

00:12:53.941 --> 00:12:56.944
Good work, everyone.
The mother ship is destroyed.

00:13:03.742 --> 00:13:05.494
