and you'll be the alcoholic,
foul-mouthed...

00:13:40.112 --> 00:13:41.613
Oh, God, you're alive!

00:13:41.822 --> 00:13:44.157
I mean, thank God, you're alive.

00:13:44.241 --> 00:13:47.327
Sorry. Check back in three days.
A week at the most.

00:13:49.538 --> 00:13:52.165
