00:14:55.771 --> 00:14:59.066
Silence! We will accept no more decoys.

00:14:59.149 --> 00:15:01.193
This is the McNeal.

00:15:01.276 --> 00:15:03.070
Wait. I know her.

00:15:03.153 --> 00:15:05.864
