All you do is watch TV.

00:15:08.951 --> 00:15:12.037
That's where I know her from.
She's Jenny McNeal.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:14.915
She was a character on a TV show
back in the 20th century.

00:15:14.998 --> 00:15:16.708
Single Female Lawyer.

00:15:16.792 --> 00:15:21.129
