00:16:33.327 --> 00:16:36.663
You know, I saw the first
30 seconds of that episode.

00:16:36.747 --> 00:16:39.666
If I could make up an ending,
maybe we could act it out ourselves.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:42.044
