00:16:45.839 --> 00:16:49.676
And I... I could be an acting coach.

00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:51.428
Let's put on a show!

00:16:54.348 --> 00:16:56.934
Okay, Leela, you'll be
starring as Jenny, who...

